{%- comment -%}
  Desktop PDP layout (Sean, 2026-10-07: shorter buy box, no gallery scroll bar).

  1. The info tabs (collapsible_tab blocks) move out of the buy box to the LEFT
     column, under the main image. Desktop only (>= 990px): on a phone the
     columns stack and the tabs stay below the buy box, where they were. The
     move is undone if the window narrows, so the page never ends up with the
     tabs stranded in a column that is no longer beside anything.
  2. The thumbnail column is no longer capped at the main image's height (it
     scrolled: 7-10 thumbnails at 88px in a 536px box). It now runs its full
     length beside the main image AND the tabs, so nothing scrolls and the
     left column has no dead space.

  The gallery's grid itself comes from the main section's custom_css (left
  thumbnail column, PRs #1039/#1040), which is at Shopify's 500-character cap;
  this block only overrides the two thumbnail properties it has to and adds a
  second grid row. Must sit AFTER the last tab in block_order: the script runs
  as the parser reaches it, so the tabs already exist and move before paint.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  /* Tabs as rounded, button-like cards (Sean, 2026-10-07, from a reference
     buy box). All widths. */
  .product__info-wrapper .product__accordion,.pdp-tabs-left .product__accordion{display:block;border:1px solid #e2dfd8 !important;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:none}
  .product__accordion.accordion::before,.product__accordion.accordion::after{display:none !important}
  .product__accordion summary{padding:16px 20px !important;border:0 !important}
  .product__accordion summary:hover{background:#faf8f4}
  .product__accordion .summary__title{gap:12px}
  .product__accordion .accordion__title{text-transform:none !important;letter-spacing:0 !important;font-weight:600;font-size:1.6rem}
  .product__accordion .accordion__content{padding:0 20px 18px !important;max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important}
  .product__accordion details[open] summary{padding-bottom:10px !important}
  @media screen and (min-width:990px){
    .product__media-wrapper media-gallery{grid-template-rows:auto 1fr}
    .product__media-wrapper media-gallery .thumbnail-slider{grid-row:1 / span 2 !important}
    .product__media-wrapper media-gallery .thumbnail-list{max-height:none !important;overflow:visible !important}
    .pdp-tabs-left{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;max-width:59.5vh;width:100%;margin-top:2.4rem;align-self:start}
  }
</style>
<script>
(function () {
  var me = document.currentScript;
  var info = me && me.closest('.product__info-container');
  var gallery = document.querySelector('.product__media-wrapper media-gallery');
  if (!info || !gallery || !window.matchMedia) return;
  var tabs = [].slice.call(info.querySelectorAll('.product__accordion'));
  if (!tabs.length) return;
  var home = document.createComment('pdp-tabs');
  tabs[0].parentNode.insertBefore(home, tabs[0]);
  var box = document.createElement('div');
  box.className = 'pdp-tabs-left';
  var mq = window.matchMedia('(min-width: 990px)');
  function place() {
    if (mq.matches) {
      tabs.forEach(function (t) { box.appendChild(t); });
      if (!box.parentNode) gallery.appendChild(box);
    } else {
      tabs.forEach(function (t) { home.parentNode.insertBefore(t, home); });
      if (box.parentNode) box.parentNode.removeChild(box);
    }
  }
  place();
  if (mq.addEventListener) mq.addEventListener('change', place); else if (mq.addListener) mq.addListener(place);
})();
</script>
